      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--nk-text);">What is vehicle ownership cost?</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--nk-text-secondary);">Owning a vehicle costs far more than fuel or EMI. The true cost adds fuel or charging, loan interest, servicing and repairs, insurance, annual vehicle tax, registration renewal, parking, tolls and washing — plus depreciation, the value your vehicle quietly loses each year. This calculator adds up your own figures so you see the real monthly, yearly and long-term cost before you buy — or to keep your current vehicle spending in check.</p>
      </section>

