        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--nk-text-secondary);">Monthly cash cost = EMI + monthly fuel or charging + annual costs ÷ 12 + monthly costs. Cost per kilometre = annual cost ÷ annual kilometres. Multi-year totals repeat fuel and monthly costs each month and annual costs each year, counting loan instalments only while the loan actually runs. Depreciation is always reported separately from cash spending.</p>
